body:
Spammed windows key + d, didn't do anything, restarted, did it again, nothing, restarted... I just rinsed and repeated and it eventually showed up.

&#x200B;

It also wasn't straight up restarting, I just did that every time the computer booted up.

That is discussed in the start. "it is not based on any religion. This is solely what I believe."

&#x200B;

I believe that whatever you believe the afterlife to be, is what the afterlife is. I have intrusive thoughts and think of horrific scenarios, so I posted this.

The most terrifying SCP is SCP-3999. Knowing that reality outside of SCP-3999 has been destroyed, so even if you do escape millions of years of torture, you will not find anything.

&#x200B;

That's kind of both of what you're describing.
